truth/ -- truth files of our own (test_lagrit_upstream)

compare_outputs.py compares every output file a LaGriT test writes with
the copy kept in that test's reference/ folder. Where the reference copy
is out of date for LaGriT itself (unchanged upstream would fail it), put
the file to compare against here instead, as truth/<test>/<file>, taken
from a run whose result is known to be correct, and say here where it
came from.

